WEBVTT

01:35.950 --> 01:40.759
[Fated Hearts]

01:41.740 --> 01:43.950
[Episode 16]

01:51.310 --> 01:53.039
Although your hand injury
can heal completely,

01:53.039 --> 01:53.560
it won't get better

01:53.560 --> 01:54.759
in just a day or two.

01:55.120 --> 01:56.000
As for lifting heavy things,

01:56.000 --> 01:57.229
let others do it for you.

01:57.229 --> 01:58.840
And archery is absolutely forbidden.

01:58.840 --> 01:59.900
Do you understand?

01:59.920 --> 02:00.720
I understand.

02:01.680 --> 02:02.790
It's all my father's fault.

02:02.790 --> 02:04.280
If he had come to Yujing earlier,

02:04.280 --> 02:04.840
your hand injury

02:04.840 --> 02:06.970
wouldn't have been delayed until now.

02:07.310 --> 02:09.139
Lord Ling helped me save Ning Fei

02:09.280 --> 02:10.539
and treated my injury.

02:10.590 --> 02:11.360
I am so thankful

02:11.360 --> 02:12.710
for such great kindness.

02:12.710 --> 02:13.910
How could I blame him?

02:14.710 --> 02:15.310
By the way,

02:16.120 --> 02:17.920
is there any news about Ning Fei?

02:18.079 --> 02:19.079
I asked my father.

02:19.310 --> 02:20.590
He told me not to inquire.

02:20.590 --> 02:21.800
He said the person has been delivered

02:21.800 --> 02:23.660
and will naturally receive help.

02:24.960 --> 02:25.560
Sister.

02:25.910 --> 02:26.820
Don't worry.

02:26.870 --> 02:27.750
As soon as there's any news,

02:27.750 --> 02:29.280
I'll tell you immediately.

02:31.960 --> 02:32.560
By the way,

02:32.630 --> 02:33.829
when are you leaving?

02:34.470 --> 02:35.160
Leaving?

02:35.650 --> 02:36.430
Heading where?

02:36.430 --> 02:37.480
Leaving Susha.

02:37.840 --> 02:38.520
Since you already know

02:38.520 --> 02:39.829
Xia Jingshi was the one
who wanted to harm you

02:39.829 --> 02:40.430
and have completely

02:40.430 --> 02:41.630
severed ties with him,

02:41.630 --> 02:43.290
why stay in Yujing any longer?

02:43.430 --> 02:45.470
My father is urging me
to return to Zhengnian Villa.

02:45.470 --> 02:46.950
Why don't you come with me?

02:47.430 --> 02:48.560
I've asked Shunzi and the others.

02:48.560 --> 02:49.430
As long as you agree,

02:49.430 --> 02:50.090
they're willing

02:50.090 --> 02:51.590
to return to Zhengnian Villa with me.

02:51.590 --> 02:52.390
Since we've become sworn sisters,

02:52.390 --> 02:53.360
and are now family,

02:53.360 --> 02:54.300
you'll be just like me.

02:54.300 --> 02:55.910
We'll both be Young Young Mistresses.

02:55.910 --> 02:56.800
If that doesn't work,

02:56.800 --> 02:58.280
I can ask my father
to adopt you as his goddaughter.

02:58.280 --> 03:00.140
That way you'll have a family too.

03:01.740 --> 03:02.430
Thank you.

03:02.910 --> 03:03.960
So you agree?

03:05.190 --> 03:06.680
But I promised Feng Suige

03:07.030 --> 03:07.800
to help him

03:07.800 --> 03:09.260
find the traitor in Susha.

03:10.960 --> 03:12.360
That's Feng Suige's business.

03:12.360 --> 03:13.870
You've helped him enough already.

03:13.870 --> 03:15.120
I’m still shaken by

03:15.150 --> 03:16.750
the previous assassination attempt on you.

03:16.750 --> 03:17.840
Aren't you afraid

03:18.120 --> 03:19.579
to continue staying here?

03:19.710 --> 03:20.440
Don't worry,

03:20.590 --> 03:22.100
I can protect myself.

03:22.800 --> 03:24.860
You haven't fallen for him, have you?

03:25.480 --> 03:27.010
What are you talking about?

03:27.560 --> 03:28.630
I just feel that

03:28.710 --> 03:29.810
your attitude toward Feng Suige

03:29.810 --> 03:31.270
is different than before.

03:31.520 --> 03:33.430
You said you were just using each other,

03:33.430 --> 03:35.760
but now you're practically inseparable.

03:35.980 --> 03:38.380
We just have important matters to discuss.

03:39.870 --> 03:41.680
You discuss things during the day,

03:41.680 --> 03:43.000
you discuss things over the night.

03:43.000 --> 03:45.530
Are there really
that many things to discuss?

03:46.360 --> 03:47.350
Miss Yixiao,

03:47.590 --> 03:48.920
someone is here for you.

03:49.520 --> 03:50.520
His Highness sent me to fetch you.

03:50.520 --> 03:52.980
He says he has important matters
to discuss.

03:54.680 --> 03:55.430
Sister.

03:56.430 --> 04:07.430
[Lotus Pavilion]

03:59.120 --> 04:00.000
Long time no see.

04:00.000 --> 04:01.460
-Come in.
-Please come in.

04:05.560 --> 04:07.620
Young Master, come in and have a seat.

04:08.190 --> 04:09.650
Come again, young Master.

04:14.520 --> 04:15.380
Your Highness.

04:25.100 --> 04:27.250
[Lotus Pavilion]

04:25.950 --> 04:27.950
Young Master, come in and take a look.

04:27.950 --> 04:28.810
Why are we here?

04:29.430 --> 04:30.390
The person who delivered silver to Xia Jingshi

04:30.390 --> 04:32.230
through the Rongtong Escort Agency

04:32.230 --> 04:33.070
is most likely a dancer here

04:33.070 --> 04:34.560
named Ruyan.

04:52.030 --> 04:52.830
What's wrong?

04:53.720 --> 04:55.650
You go in first. I'll be right back.

04:58.510 --> 05:00.570
Young Master, come in and have a seat.

05:07.880 --> 05:09.340
Come, please step inside.

05:18.860 --> 05:20.460
Are you alone, Young Master?

05:22.950 --> 05:24.550
Could you please ask

05:25.270 --> 05:26.470
for Miss Ruyan for me?

05:26.750 --> 05:28.240
Ruyan already has an appointment today.

05:28.240 --> 05:29.270
Why not let me

05:29.310 --> 05:30.490
keep you company for a few drinks?

05:30.490 --> 05:31.480
May I ask who

05:31.510 --> 05:33.430
has an appointment with Miss Ruyan?

05:33.430 --> 05:34.630
Young Master Murong.

05:35.120 --> 05:36.000
Miss Linglan.

05:39.159 --> 05:39.670
Sui...

05:40.630 --> 05:41.470
Suige?

05:41.580 --> 05:42.680
What are you doing here?

05:42.680 --> 05:43.240
I thought you

05:43.240 --> 05:44.970
don't come to places like this.

05:45.360 --> 05:46.290
What's going on?

05:47.270 --> 05:48.470
Why did you come here?

05:48.510 --> 05:50.270
Didn't I ask you to watch the villa?

05:50.270 --> 05:52.159
Don't worry, I've arranged everything.

05:52.159 --> 05:52.750
Even the servants,

05:52.750 --> 05:53.920
I've replaced them with my own people.

05:53.920 --> 05:54.750
If anything happens,

05:54.750 --> 05:56.550
I'll know about it immediately.

05:56.800 --> 05:57.630
You... I really...

05:57.630 --> 05:59.190
I'm not interfering with your business.

05:59.190 --> 06:00.050
Think about it,

06:00.510 --> 06:01.190
I can't just stand guard

06:01.190 --> 06:02.360
at the villa entrance every day, can I?

06:02.360 --> 06:02.830
Then wouldn't I have just

06:02.830 --> 06:04.690
become nothing but a doorkeeper?

06:05.920 --> 06:06.790
Don't worry.

06:07.270 --> 06:08.330
Miss Linglan.

06:08.510 --> 06:10.340
Haven’t seen you in a few days
and you’ve gotten prettier!

06:10.340 --> 06:11.080
Thank you.

06:11.240 --> 06:12.240
Where is your sister?

06:12.240 --> 06:14.040
She is waiting for you upstairs.

06:15.480 --> 06:16.950
No wonder they say you're lucky.

06:16.950 --> 06:18.070
It took me half a month of waiting

06:18.070 --> 06:18.560
before I finally

06:18.560 --> 06:19.680
secured a meeting with Miss Ruyan.

06:19.680 --> 06:21.340
You're much luckier than I am.

06:21.720 --> 06:22.520
I'm going now.

06:23.030 --> 06:24.600
Let's go. Since you're already here.

06:24.600 --> 06:26.920
Let me tell you, her dancing is really...

06:47.920 --> 06:48.840
Miss Ruyan.

06:48.890 --> 06:49.510
This is

06:49.510 --> 06:51.120
my best friend since childhood.

06:51.120 --> 06:52.850
He's a rare and honoured guest.

06:53.000 --> 06:54.860
Make sure he's well taken care of.

06:55.159 --> 06:57.040
Young Master, you look distinguished.

06:57.040 --> 06:58.640
Surely a man of great talent.

06:58.690 --> 07:00.820
Please enjoy yourselves, gentlemen.

07:00.870 --> 07:03.090
I'll go change into my attire.

07:03.510 --> 07:04.040
Go ahead.

07:04.040 --> 07:05.360
That won't be necessary.

07:05.360 --> 07:06.270
I didn't come here today

07:06.270 --> 07:07.800
to enjoy music and dancing.

07:08.110 --> 07:09.830
No need to change your clothes.

07:09.830 --> 07:11.300
Then what brings you here?

07:11.560 --> 07:13.090
I have something to ask you.

07:13.800 --> 07:14.330
Come.

07:14.560 --> 07:15.560
No need to be formal.

07:15.560 --> 07:16.090
Sit down.

07:18.680 --> 07:19.810
Sit down. It's fine.

07:20.040 --> 07:20.510
Sit.

07:21.270 --> 07:22.090
Listen to what my friend

07:22.090 --> 07:22.820
has to ask you

07:22.830 --> 07:24.430
and just answer truthfully.

07:24.430 --> 07:24.950
Yes.

07:26.360 --> 07:26.870
What?

07:28.120 --> 07:29.450
You need to leave first.

07:29.950 --> 07:30.690
Me? Leave?

07:30.720 --> 07:31.780
Why should I leave?

07:31.830 --> 07:33.430
Don't ask about things

07:33.430 --> 07:34.290
you shouldn't.

07:35.390 --> 07:36.240
What secrets

07:36.240 --> 07:37.280
could you two be hiding?

07:37.280 --> 07:38.600
Didn't you just tell me

07:38.620 --> 07:39.600
that you've never met her before?

07:39.600 --> 07:40.560
Isn't this your first time here?

07:40.560 --> 07:42.140
You lied to me, did you?

07:42.240 --> 07:43.000
Get out.

07:43.830 --> 07:45.120
I'm the one who made the appointment
with Miss Ruyan.

07:45.120 --> 07:46.480
You're just riding on my coattails.

07:46.480 --> 07:47.480
Do you know how many rich young men

07:47.480 --> 07:48.909
in the capital are waiting in line?

07:48.909 --> 07:50.409
I paid a lot.

07:55.960 --> 07:57.480
Are you sure you're just asking questions?

07:57.480 --> 07:58.940
What else would I be doing?

08:00.920 --> 08:01.790
Then hurry up.

08:06.830 --> 08:07.490
Wait for me.

08:10.360 --> 08:11.560
No need to be nervous.

08:11.870 --> 08:13.400
I just have some questions.

08:15.390 --> 08:15.920
Alright.

08:34.179 --> 08:35.380
Two bowls of noodles.

08:36.030 --> 08:38.090
Miss Xiaoxue, you're here early today.

08:38.090 --> 08:39.620
Please make it quick today.

08:39.960 --> 08:40.730
Sure thing.

08:46.420 --> 08:47.230
Coming right up.

08:47.230 --> 08:47.890
Here you go.

09:02.650 --> 09:03.850
[Stand by outside Yujing City]

09:07.320 --> 09:08.840
Rongtong Escort Agency?

09:09.480 --> 09:11.000
Young Master, you come to my dance house

09:11.000 --> 09:12.260
not to enjoy the dance

09:12.440 --> 09:14.240
but to ask about the escort agency?

09:14.240 --> 09:16.240
Did you have Rongtong Escort Agency

09:16.320 --> 09:18.550
deliver something to Pingling City
in Jinxiu?

09:18.550 --> 09:19.360
Yes, I did.

09:20.000 --> 09:21.060
What was delivered

09:21.150 --> 09:22.000
and to whom?

09:22.670 --> 09:24.030
That I don't know.

09:25.120 --> 09:27.390
Young Master, please don't glare at me.

09:27.420 --> 09:28.840
You're scaring me.

09:29.190 --> 09:32.140
Please tell me the truth, Miss Ruyan.

09:33.550 --> 09:35.920
I was entrusted by a patron

09:36.000 --> 09:38.000
to arrange a delivery
with the escort agency.

09:38.000 --> 09:39.790
But in our line of work,

09:39.790 --> 09:41.200
we avoid asking questions.

09:41.200 --> 09:43.530
So what was delivered and to whom,

09:43.670 --> 09:45.110
I didn't ask at all.

09:45.390 --> 09:46.600
Then this patron,

09:47.030 --> 09:47.630
who is he?

09:47.910 --> 09:49.100
Young Master.

09:49.270 --> 09:50.870
If I reveal his name,

09:50.910 --> 09:53.030
I won't be able to survive
in Yujing City anymore.

09:53.030 --> 09:54.440
Please stop asking, Young Master.

09:54.440 --> 09:55.510
I won't tell you.

09:56.270 --> 09:58.600
Miss Ruyan, I'm afraid you don't know that

09:58.600 --> 09:59.730
if you don't tell me,

10:00.030 --> 10:01.000
the consequences will be

10:01.000 --> 10:02.670
a thousand times worse.

10:05.860 --> 10:06.840
The last time

10:06.840 --> 10:08.170
I broke someone's neck,

10:08.420 --> 10:10.420
I didn't apply the right technique.

10:10.620 --> 10:11.320
So it caused that person

10:11.320 --> 10:12.930
to take an hour to die.

10:13.240 --> 10:14.980
The pain was unbearable.

10:15.080 --> 10:17.960
Who are you really, Young Master?

10:18.360 --> 10:20.360
You folks are well-informed here.

10:21.080 --> 10:22.840
Surely you've heard about

10:22.840 --> 10:25.100
who had their neck broken in Yujing City?

10:26.870 --> 10:27.510
You are...

10:28.510 --> 10:29.850
The First Prince?

10:30.200 --> 10:31.670
Miss Ruyan, I ask that

10:31.750 --> 10:33.120
you tell me the truth.

10:34.600 --> 10:36.820
The person who hired me that day

10:36.870 --> 10:38.840
was Manager Luo from Changsheng Bank.

10:38.840 --> 10:40.640
He was too drunk to walk that day,

10:40.720 --> 10:42.030
and was afraid
of delaying important business,

10:42.030 --> 10:44.270
so he asked me to visit the escort agency.

10:44.270 --> 10:45.960
He even gave me some silver as payment.

10:45.960 --> 10:47.600
As for what the goods were,

10:47.660 --> 10:48.830
I have no idea.

10:49.200 --> 10:50.240
I swear to heaven.

10:50.260 --> 10:50.910
I was just running errands

10:50.910 --> 10:52.150
and delivering messages for him.

10:52.150 --> 10:53.720
If there was anything wrong
with the goods,

10:53.720 --> 10:55.920
it has absolutely nothing to do with me.

10:59.510 --> 11:00.630
I swear to heaven.

11:00.670 --> 11:02.390
There's not a single lie
in what I've said,

11:02.390 --> 11:03.120
or else,

11:03.320 --> 11:04.570
may I die of festering sores

11:04.570 --> 11:06.100
and never be reincarnated.

11:26.120 --> 11:26.670
Good.

11:26.750 --> 11:27.810
Nice performance.

11:31.360 --> 11:31.890
Let's go.

11:34.440 --> 11:35.270
What is your reason

11:35.270 --> 11:36.120
for looking for Miss Ruyan?

11:36.120 --> 11:37.470
What is it that I can't know about?

11:37.470 --> 11:38.900
It's none of your business.

11:38.900 --> 11:39.670
That won't do.

11:39.670 --> 11:40.630
If it concerns Miss Ruyan,

11:40.630 --> 11:41.760
then it concerns me.

11:42.910 --> 11:44.150
I just wanted to ask Miss Ruyan

11:44.150 --> 11:45.110
some questions.

11:45.320 --> 11:47.320
It really has nothing to do with you.

11:48.500 --> 11:49.630
Where are you going?

11:50.270 --> 11:51.980
You don't know how to treat a lady.

11:51.980 --> 11:53.380
You must have scared her.

11:53.600 --> 11:55.120
-I need to comfort her.
-His Majesty entrusted

11:55.120 --> 11:56.150
the Imperial Guards to you.

11:56.150 --> 11:57.570
Such an important responsibility
given to you,

11:57.570 --> 11:58.120
and here you are

11:58.120 --> 11:59.400
chasing after women.

11:59.510 --> 12:00.970
And in broad daylight too.

12:01.000 --> 12:01.790
As if you're afraid people don't know

12:01.790 --> 12:02.730
who you are.

12:02.870 --> 12:03.390
Yes.

12:04.150 --> 12:05.880
Then I'll come back after dark.

12:06.320 --> 12:08.190
I really want to kick you to death.

12:08.440 --> 12:10.410
You're bluffing. You wouldn't bear to.

12:10.410 --> 12:11.670
Just let me say a word to her.

12:11.670 --> 12:12.670
Comfort her a bit.

12:13.200 --> 12:14.100
Go, go, go.

12:17.240 --> 12:18.150
The Junior Marquis hasn't changed a bit

12:18.150 --> 12:19.320
over all these years.

12:19.320 --> 12:20.840
Just playing around for fun.

12:20.840 --> 12:21.750
Nobody can control him.

12:21.750 --> 12:22.550
Go and bring Manager Luo

12:22.550 --> 12:24.190
from Changsheng Bank

12:24.390 --> 12:25.720
to meet me immediately.

12:25.830 --> 12:26.360
Wait.

12:27.270 --> 12:28.180
Where's Yixiao?

12:28.180 --> 12:29.310
Why hasn't she returned yet?

12:29.310 --> 12:30.440
She said to let you go in first.

12:30.440 --> 12:31.550
It shouldn't take too long.

12:31.550 --> 12:32.430
It's been an incense stick's time already.

12:32.430 --> 12:34.030
Why hasn't she come back yet?

12:38.280 --> 12:39.140
Don't worry about me.

12:39.140 --> 12:41.000
Go find Manager Luo immediately.

14:38.120 --> 14:38.670
Hurry up.

15:48.320 --> 15:50.190
Following me all the way here.

15:50.210 --> 15:51.320
Didn't you consider

15:51.320 --> 15:53.180
that I deliberately led you here?

15:57.000 --> 15:58.550
It seems all the skills I taught you

15:58.550 --> 16:00.410
have been completely forgotten.

16:01.000 --> 16:02.240
Fu Yixiao.

16:16.910 --> 16:17.840
All of you

16:17.840 --> 16:19.790
carry deep blood feuds.

16:19.870 --> 16:21.400
You have no family, no ties.

16:21.550 --> 16:22.150
Your lives

16:22.750 --> 16:24.020
are as cheap as ants.

16:24.270 --> 16:26.120
If you wish to survive here,

16:26.840 --> 16:28.000
you must become

16:28.000 --> 16:29.600
the bravest death warriors.

16:36.720 --> 16:37.320
You...

16:38.790 --> 16:39.920
You're still alive.

16:40.600 --> 16:41.200
What?

16:42.360 --> 16:43.390
Hoping I was dead?

16:44.000 --> 16:46.550
I treated you well back then.

17:36.590 --> 17:37.880
How would the hideout of the death camp

17:37.880 --> 17:39.200
not have any traps,

17:39.200 --> 17:41.260
allowing strangers to enter freely?

17:41.550 --> 17:42.880
You were too careless.

17:45.720 --> 17:47.000
Muscle-weakening incense.

17:47.000 --> 17:48.050
It won't kill you.

17:48.240 --> 17:49.480
It only makes your entire body

17:49.480 --> 17:50.830
weak and powerless.

17:51.400 --> 17:51.920
Be good.

17:52.440 --> 17:53.480
Don't resist.

17:55.160 --> 17:56.640
Why are you still alive?

17:58.750 --> 18:00.750
Naturally because of His Highness.

18:03.070 --> 18:04.110
It was His Highness who gave me

18:04.110 --> 18:05.370
the chance to survive.

18:08.350 --> 18:09.280
His Highness...

18:16.350 --> 18:17.630
As for you.

18:17.790 --> 18:20.190
If His Highness hadn't saved you
back then,

18:20.400 --> 18:22.680
how could you have survived until today?

18:24.000 --> 18:26.200
Not only are you ungrateful,

18:27.200 --> 18:29.130
you're even thinking of betrayal.

18:34.440 --> 18:35.640
How is that possible?

18:36.000 --> 18:37.600
How could it be His Highness?

18:37.680 --> 18:38.980
He clearly told me

18:39.020 --> 18:40.150
that the death camp

18:41.030 --> 18:42.890
had been completely eliminated.

18:45.270 --> 18:47.470
The death camp belongs to His Highness.

18:47.920 --> 18:48.880
Why would anyone

18:48.880 --> 18:51.200
eliminate their own power base?

18:54.160 --> 18:55.550
If His Highness hadn't said

18:55.550 --> 18:57.920
the death camp was completely eliminated,

18:57.920 --> 19:00.000
how could you have spent all these years

19:00.000 --> 19:02.510
being so devoted to him?

19:07.880 --> 19:09.640
If I could expose myself,

19:09.750 --> 19:11.910
I would have killed you

19:12.110 --> 19:13.110
on the day you entered Yujing.

19:13.110 --> 19:14.240
I wouldn't need those undercover guards

19:14.240 --> 19:15.970
from His Highness' Residence.

19:40.550 --> 19:41.350
Yixiao.

19:45.680 --> 19:46.440
Yixiao.

19:56.830 --> 19:58.630
If you want to kill me, then do it.

19:58.750 --> 19:59.510
Go ahead.

20:01.400 --> 20:02.400
I can't kill you.

20:03.030 --> 20:03.920
If I kill you,

20:04.030 --> 20:06.030
His Highness would surely blame me.

20:07.720 --> 20:09.380
But His Highness won't expect

20:09.400 --> 20:11.560
that you come here today.

20:12.110 --> 20:12.790
So...

20:13.590 --> 20:14.390
Rest assured.

20:14.790 --> 20:17.960
I'll make you die silently,

20:19.240 --> 20:21.350
leaving no trace.

20:51.640 --> 20:52.680
Save me!

20:54.510 --> 20:55.830
Please save me!

21:00.640 --> 21:02.640
Help!

21:07.890 --> 21:08.990
Hold on!

21:09.230 --> 21:10.230
I'll get you out.

21:11.000 --> 21:11.640
Hold on!

21:14.790 --> 21:15.880
Save me!

21:17.160 --> 21:18.280
Hold on!

21:32.720 --> 21:34.700
♪ Awaiting dusk ♪

21:35.110 --> 21:38.430
♪ Shadows take root in the mountain pass ♪

21:38.980 --> 21:44.790
♪ In just a moment, tears stained ♪

21:40.390 --> 21:42.360
You are quite beautiful.

21:42.480 --> 21:45.040
You could be trained in seduction arts
and kept as an assassin.

21:45.040 --> 21:47.250
♪ Amid the bustling sound
of wind and rain ♪

21:45.640 --> 21:46.830
You can't have any scars on you.

21:46.830 --> 21:48.680
But, you needs to know

21:47.560 --> 21:51.490
♪ Who laughs at me,
heart cold as the desert? ♪

21:48.830 --> 21:50.360
this searing taste of iron.

21:51.720 --> 21:53.450
♪ Dreams turn through a lifetime ♪

21:53.860 --> 21:57.700
♪ Who sighs for me,
enduring separations? ♪

21:58.130 --> 22:00.240
♪ Love is a trial, harsh and cold ♪

21:58.920 --> 22:00.220
I'll get you out.

22:00.630 --> 22:03.620
♪ Who crushes the lingering pain for me? ♪

22:01.270 --> 22:02.870
I'll definitely get you out.

22:04.220 --> 22:09.610
♪ Clouds vanish, rain ceases, seek me ♪

22:06.460 --> 22:07.540
Hold on.

22:08.070 --> 22:09.030
Hang in there!

22:13.320 --> 22:16.650
♪ The world is vast and far ♪

22:20.030 --> 22:22.800
♪ Time is unbearable to endure ♪

22:22.530 --> 22:23.740
Live on!

22:23.620 --> 22:26.350
♪ Lost in the wilderness ♪

22:27.150 --> 22:29.420
♪ I've been looking for you ♪

22:28.310 --> 22:29.750
Live on!

22:30.180 --> 22:32.590
♪ Even if devastation fills my eyes ♪

22:33.340 --> 22:35.770
♪ The shadows continue to sway ♪

22:33.640 --> 22:34.440
Fire!

22:34.440 --> 22:37.270
Fire! Help put it out! Hurry!

22:36.450 --> 22:39.150
♪ The phoenix going against light ♪

22:37.680 --> 22:39.920
Fire!

22:39.820 --> 22:42.480
♪ Has been looking for a thousand miles ♪

22:42.990 --> 22:45.700
♪ As years pass, dust stirs,
stirring deep longing ♪

22:46.650 --> 22:51.520
♪ All I ask is to be together  forever ♪

22:57.680 --> 23:00.410
♪ If nothing said, then nothing heard;
if no will, then no us♪

23:00.980 --> 23:03.600
♪ The moon is clear yet heartless ♪

23:04.270 --> 23:06.380
♪ No love, no longing;
no meeting, no missing ♪

23:07.120 --> 23:09.620
♪ With high mountains and long roads,
a life adrift ♪

23:10.300 --> 23:12.480
♪ A life adrift ♪

23:13.240 --> 23:16.150
♪ Lost in the wilderness ♪

23:13.720 --> 23:14.160
Yixiao.

23:14.160 --> 23:15.200
You must survive.

23:16.800 --> 23:19.310
♪ I've been looking for you ♪

23:19.070 --> 23:20.070
Live on.

23:19.830 --> 23:22.370
♪ Even if the wilderness is boundless ♪

23:21.540 --> 23:22.860
Let me go!

23:23.400 --> 23:24.590
Let me go!

23:23.480 --> 23:25.530
♪ We won't separate ♪

23:26.200 --> 23:28.030
You must survive!

23:26.200 --> 23:29.330
♪ In the dark night, I look back ♪

23:28.720 --> 23:29.960
No!

23:29.680 --> 23:32.480
♪ Amid despair ♪

23:31.070 --> 23:34.590
You must survive!

23:33.250 --> 23:35.710
♪ A grain of incense, a tear,
an inch of ash ♪

23:36.300 --> 23:39.190
♪ Gathered and parted, all for you ♪

23:43.110 --> 23:44.880
Put me down! I need to save her!

23:44.960 --> 23:45.640
Listen to me!

23:45.640 --> 23:46.400
I have to save her!

23:46.400 --> 23:46.790
Yixiao.

23:46.790 --> 23:47.880
I need to save her! I need her to survive!

23:47.880 --> 23:48.510
Yixiao.

23:48.830 --> 23:50.000
She's already dead!

23:53.350 --> 23:54.370
If you go in now,

23:54.090 --> 23:56.610
♪ I search for you, yet cannot find you ♪

23:54.640 --> 23:56.570
you'll only burn to death with her.

24:13.960 --> 24:16.810
[Wutong Mansion]

24:25.350 --> 24:26.030
Come on.

24:39.830 --> 24:40.680
Previously, Xia Jingshi

24:40.680 --> 24:42.540
mentioned in his notes given to me

24:42.870 --> 24:43.680
that after he rescued me

24:43.680 --> 24:45.270
from the death camp,

24:45.550 --> 24:46.260
the death camp had already

24:46.260 --> 24:47.920
been completely eliminated,

24:48.240 --> 24:50.240
and their leader Wu Ying had died.

24:51.310 --> 24:52.110
But now...

24:53.160 --> 24:54.310
Why is there suddenly

24:54.310 --> 24:55.910
the same death camp in Susha?

24:56.200 --> 24:57.860
And why is Wu Ying still alive?

24:58.270 --> 25:00.200
What exactly is this death camp?

25:06.480 --> 25:07.680
They specifically abduct

25:07.680 --> 25:08.750
young men

25:08.830 --> 25:09.440
and

25:09.440 --> 25:10.940
beautiful young maidens,

25:11.110 --> 25:12.000
training them to become

25:12.000 --> 25:13.390
killing machines.

25:13.440 --> 25:14.240
In that place,

25:15.130 --> 25:16.790
your survival is not up to you,

25:17.480 --> 25:18.960
nor is your death.

25:27.830 --> 25:28.640
Is that death camp

25:28.640 --> 25:30.350
connected to Xia Jingshi?

25:30.640 --> 25:31.240
Yes.

25:32.070 --> 25:33.350
Wu Ying told me herself

25:34.940 --> 25:37.510
that Xia Jingshi was the one
who released her back then.

25:37.510 --> 25:39.140
Xia Jingshi saved me,

25:39.310 --> 25:40.110
Xiao Weiran

25:40.830 --> 25:41.720
and Ning Fei,

25:42.440 --> 25:43.310
just to make us

25:43.310 --> 25:44.640
completely loyal to him

25:44.880 --> 25:46.210
and serve his purposes.

25:46.240 --> 25:47.400
No wonder Xia Jingshi

25:47.400 --> 25:48.350
came to Susha for marriage alliance

25:48.350 --> 25:49.960
without bringing any soldiers.

25:49.960 --> 25:51.820
He seems harmless on the surface,

25:52.790 --> 25:54.160
but in reality, the death camp

25:54.160 --> 25:55.600
is his deadly weapon,

25:55.720 --> 25:56.240
extremely crucial

25:56.240 --> 25:58.360
to their upcoming plans.

25:58.440 --> 25:59.770
Whatever his plans are,

26:00.240 --> 26:01.030
I absolutely cannot allow

26:01.030 --> 26:02.490
a place like the death camp

26:03.110 --> 26:03.720
that's so utterly inhumane

26:03.720 --> 26:05.000
to exist in this world.

26:24.440 --> 26:25.170
Don't worry.

26:26.240 --> 26:27.560
With me by your side,

26:28.590 --> 26:29.830
I will stand with you

26:30.310 --> 26:32.110
to turn all your past enemies,

26:33.350 --> 26:34.880
those who keep you awake at night,

26:34.880 --> 26:36.510
those you hate to the core,

26:36.790 --> 26:39.000
into nothing but bones beneath our feet.

26:38.940 --> 26:41.800
♪ Take down the setting sun as my heart ♪

26:42.380 --> 26:45.810
♪ Fold the heaven and earth
to make my wings ♪

26:46.300 --> 26:47.690
♪ If fate shows no mercy ♪

26:48.180 --> 26:51.830
♪ Then don't blame my recklessness ♪

26:49.720 --> 26:50.590
It's a deal.

26:51.270 --> 26:52.240
A deal.

26:53.620 --> 26:56.830
♪ I thought this life
would drift like a solitary sail ♪

26:54.160 --> 26:54.720
Alright,

26:54.880 --> 26:55.810
get some rest now

26:55.880 --> 26:57.210
and stop overthinking.

26:57.250 --> 27:00.410
♪ Yet I chanced upon you
in the smoke-filled alleyway ♪

26:58.200 --> 26:58.880
I'm fine,

26:59.550 --> 27:00.280
don't worry.

27:00.880 --> 27:02.200
Lord Ling already said

27:00.950 --> 27:03.620
♪ Like a fleeting flower falling into ♪

27:03.110 --> 27:03.880
you cannot be upset

27:03.880 --> 27:05.070
by anything right now.

27:04.220 --> 27:06.910
♪ My eyes ♪

27:06.030 --> 27:06.830
Rest assured.

27:07.160 --> 27:08.160
I'll send people to find the whereabouts

27:07.180 --> 27:08.710
♪ Once I was like a frost-edged sword ♪

27:08.160 --> 27:09.270
of those death warriors.

27:09.180 --> 27:10.620
♪ Sweeping across the battlefield
in gleaming light ♪

27:10.310 --> 27:10.970
Go to sleep.

27:12.010 --> 27:14.150
♪ Never thought who'd lay me to rest ♪

27:12.070 --> 27:12.680
Okay.

27:13.720 --> 27:14.510
I'll listen to you.

27:14.500 --> 27:15.960
♪ Once unstoppable and sharp ♪

27:16.370 --> 27:18.940
♪ Now my heart's tied to you ♪

27:19.410 --> 27:21.600
♪ Thinking of you day and night ♪

27:23.940 --> 27:26.360
♪ I suddenly realize
ripples are spreading ♪

27:26.720 --> 27:30.650
♪ Melting the frost,
lingering in my heart ♪

27:31.120 --> 27:32.580
♪ The light between your brows ♪

27:32.850 --> 27:34.810
♪ Is the kind of bloom ♪

27:35.110 --> 27:38.130
♪ That I love the most ♪

27:38.860 --> 27:41.060
♪ I truly feel I can forgive it all ♪

27:41.590 --> 27:45.370
♪ The sky's vast and the road's long,
but with you by my side ♪

27:45.780 --> 27:47.450
♪ The twists and turns don't count ♪

27:47.850 --> 27:52.570
♪ I can tell with tears
that I have not lived in vain ♪

27:51.790 --> 27:52.650
Your Highness.

27:53.970 --> 27:54.790
Ten days ago,

27:55.110 --> 27:55.640
Manager Luo got drunk

27:55.640 --> 27:57.070
and drowned after falling into the river.

27:57.070 --> 27:57.880
I went to the Luo family.

27:57.880 --> 27:58.400
His wife and children

27:58.400 --> 27:59.720
have already taken his coffin
back to their hometown.

27:59.720 --> 28:01.250
He must have been murdered.

28:01.640 --> 28:02.270
Ten days ago,

28:02.270 --> 28:04.070
we hadn't yet investigated
the escort agency.

28:04.070 --> 28:05.920
Seems they were prepared all along.

28:05.920 --> 28:07.270
Yes, we've lost this lead again.

28:07.270 --> 28:08.350
What should we do now?

28:08.350 --> 28:09.510
What about those riders?

28:09.510 --> 28:10.070
Around 4 PM,

28:10.070 --> 28:11.070
they passed by you

28:11.110 --> 28:12.910
and left through the south gate.

28:15.000 --> 28:16.480
Go back to camp and get Song Cheng.

28:16.480 --> 28:17.590
Tell him that no matter what,

28:17.590 --> 28:18.240
he must find

28:18.240 --> 28:19.270
where these people are.

28:19.270 --> 28:19.920
Yes.

28:37.400 --> 28:38.590
Do you want me

28:38.590 --> 28:39.720
to apologize to you?

28:41.030 --> 28:41.880
No.

28:42.590 --> 28:44.440
You sent someone to summon me
to the palace.

28:44.440 --> 28:45.110
I came,

28:45.750 --> 28:47.550
but you're not saying anything.

28:51.480 --> 28:53.920
Don't act like
you've done something wrong.

28:53.920 --> 28:55.580
You didn't do anything wrong.

28:55.960 --> 28:57.560
It was I who made the mistake.

29:00.000 --> 29:00.750
I should have told you

29:00.750 --> 29:02.550
about my plan to detain Xia Jingshi

29:02.550 --> 29:04.200
in Susha beforehand.

29:05.350 --> 29:06.480
After all,

29:07.310 --> 29:08.770
he is your future husband.

29:09.590 --> 29:10.400
This matter

29:11.510 --> 29:13.070
is my fault.

29:13.790 --> 29:15.790
Brother, you don't need to say that.

29:16.350 --> 29:18.750
I'm not trying to please you deliberately.

29:19.310 --> 29:20.840
I'm speaking from my heart.

29:23.590 --> 29:25.350
I was wrong that day.

29:26.350 --> 29:28.680
I shouldn't have said those things to you.

29:30.440 --> 29:31.720
No matter what you say,

29:32.310 --> 29:33.970
you are still my royal sister.

29:34.350 --> 29:35.720
How could I blame you?

29:36.440 --> 29:37.570
You've grown up now.

29:37.920 --> 29:39.750
You're no longer that little girl

29:39.750 --> 29:40.550
who needed her brother

29:40.550 --> 29:42.150
to protect her at every turn.

29:43.070 --> 29:44.400
You have your own thoughts

29:44.400 --> 29:45.730
and your own decisions.

29:45.960 --> 29:47.560
I can understand all of that.

29:48.680 --> 29:50.160
I shouldn't have made you

29:50.590 --> 29:52.190
live according to my wishes.

29:53.160 --> 29:54.420
That's not fair to you.

29:55.070 --> 29:56.550
But as your brother,

29:57.270 --> 30:00.030
anticipating problems and keeping you
from danger is my duty.

30:00.030 --> 30:01.360
This is what I should do.

30:03.110 --> 30:04.570
Whether you listen or not,

30:05.240 --> 30:06.830
I've said all I can say.

30:07.720 --> 30:08.510
Brother.

30:08.920 --> 30:09.650
Don't worry.

30:10.790 --> 30:12.120
No matter who you marry,

30:12.720 --> 30:13.960
as long as it's someone you love

30:13.960 --> 30:15.290
and you won't regret it,

30:15.510 --> 30:16.750
I will support you.

30:18.440 --> 30:19.000
Because

30:19.000 --> 30:20.160
more than anyone else in this world,

30:20.160 --> 30:21.440
I want you to be happy.

30:22.720 --> 30:23.880
Only if you live well

30:24.880 --> 30:26.810
can I fulfill my promise to Mother.

30:32.470 --> 30:33.070
Alright.

30:33.750 --> 30:34.480
Don't worry.

30:35.240 --> 30:36.270
And don't let me

30:36.480 --> 30:37.400
ruin your mood.

30:38.110 --> 30:39.370
It's your wedding day.

30:40.110 --> 30:41.310
You should be happy.

30:43.440 --> 30:44.640
Will you

30:45.790 --> 30:47.050
come on my wedding day?

30:52.920 --> 30:53.720
Of course.

30:55.400 --> 30:58.460
I will certainly watch you get married
with my own eyes.

31:00.160 --> 31:00.750
Xiyang,

31:01.750 --> 31:03.210
as long as you can be happy,

31:03.550 --> 31:04.810
I can accept anything.

31:12.480 --> 31:13.440
Even if I know

31:13.440 --> 31:15.040
you might regret it someday,

31:15.640 --> 31:16.920
I must respect

31:16.920 --> 31:18.160
your current wishes.

31:34.900 --> 31:36.870
♪ Flying alone ♪

31:37.270 --> 31:40.270
♪ With no need for direction ♪

31:42.470 --> 31:44.600
♪ Flying up to the clouds ♪

31:45.200 --> 31:47.850
♪ Yet the sun is hiding ♪

31:50.310 --> 31:51.920
♪ Roaming freely ♪

31:52.470 --> 31:55.650
♪ Unafraid of wind or frost ♪

31:57.670 --> 31:59.500
♪ The wet wings ♪

31:59.890 --> 32:03.250
♪ Will carry me far away ♪

32:07.380 --> 32:10.590
♪ Don't cry, don't cry ♪

32:13.110 --> 32:17.430
♪ I'll remember the way home ♪

32:14.510 --> 32:16.270
The royal decree.

32:17.270 --> 32:18.870
Be cautious and respectful.

32:19.480 --> 32:21.680
Day and night, do not disobey commands.

32:21.960 --> 32:23.110
Be diligent and respectful.

32:22.130 --> 32:25.500
♪ Don't cry, don't cry ♪

32:23.400 --> 32:25.860
Day and night,
do not neglect palace duties.

32:25.920 --> 32:27.450
I am getting married today.

32:27.920 --> 32:29.310
From now on, I cannot serve

32:28.230 --> 32:33.070
♪ I'll find the way home ♪

32:29.310 --> 32:31.040
Father and Mother by your side.

32:32.000 --> 32:33.680
I hope Father and Mother

32:34.400 --> 32:36.330
will take good care of yourselves.

32:36.640 --> 32:38.720
The Prince of Zhennan
has exceptional talent.

32:38.720 --> 32:40.250
He is a gentleman of virtue.

32:40.590 --> 32:41.790
This marriage alliance

32:41.790 --> 32:43.270
is also for Susha and Jinxiu

32:43.270 --> 32:44.830
to maintain eternal friendship.

32:44.830 --> 32:46.630
I hope you will keep this in mind.

32:46.790 --> 32:48.240
Among all my children,

32:49.070 --> 32:51.470
you are the most considerate and sensible.

32:52.310 --> 32:54.510
You have put your father's mind at ease.

32:55.510 --> 32:56.680
This marriage,

32:57.270 --> 33:00.530
although it is a marriage alliance
between two countries,

33:01.070 --> 33:03.330
you must never allow yourself to suffer.

33:05.250 --> 33:07.180
♪ Roaming freely ♪

33:07.420 --> 33:10.720
♪ Unafraid of wind or frost ♪

33:12.610 --> 33:14.550
♪ The wet wings ♪

33:14.830 --> 33:18.310
♪ Will carry me far away ♪

33:24.160 --> 33:27.480
♪ Don't cry, don't cry ♪

33:30.530 --> 33:34.650
♪ Don't cry, don't cry ♪

33:31.440 --> 33:32.300
Your Highness,

33:33.680 --> 33:35.680
Princess is getting married today.

33:36.640 --> 33:38.040
Are you really not going?

33:58.960 --> 34:01.030
As the eastern sun rises,

34:01.350 --> 34:03.160
the graceful maiden

34:03.310 --> 34:05.440
stands within his chamber.

34:12.280 --> 34:14.000
Stands within his chamber

34:14.510 --> 34:17.320
drawing him near.

34:18.400 --> 34:20.590
As the eastern moon ascends,

34:20.840 --> 34:22.590
the graceful maiden

34:23.030 --> 34:25.000
lingers at his doorway.

34:37.510 --> 34:39.480
Lingers at his doorway

34:40.280 --> 34:43.280
brushing past his hair.

34:57.400 --> 35:00.440
First bow to heaven and earth.

35:12.440 --> 35:15.920
Second bow to the parents.

35:45.360 --> 35:48.590
Husband and wife bow to each other.

36:05.070 --> 36:07.440
The ceremony is complete.

36:16.030 --> 36:17.670
Today is Sister's wedding.

36:18.150 --> 36:19.710
Why isn't Brother here?

37:51.880 --> 37:52.740
How beautiful!

38:11.360 --> 38:12.550
The Yujing City tonight

38:12.550 --> 38:13.510
is truly lively.

38:14.480 --> 38:15.760
It's Princess' wedding.

38:15.760 --> 38:17.320
The whole city celebrates it,

38:17.320 --> 38:19.650
and those in love will also go out
in pairs.

38:19.880 --> 38:21.590
Your Highness, have you ever thought

38:21.590 --> 38:24.050
about what kind of woman
you'd marry one day?

38:30.070 --> 38:31.840
I never thought about it before.

38:31.840 --> 38:33.030
Never before,

38:33.550 --> 38:34.610
but what about now?

38:36.920 --> 38:39.460
♪ I suddenly realize
ripples are spreading ♪

38:39.690 --> 38:43.800
♪ Melting the frost,
lingering in my heart ♪

38:44.210 --> 38:45.820
♪ The light between your brows ♪

38:46.070 --> 38:48.020
♪ Is the kind of bloom ♪

38:48.350 --> 38:51.030
♪ That I love the most ♪

38:50.800 --> 38:51.780
It's so lively over there.

38:51.780 --> 38:54.350
♪ I truly feel I can forgive it all ♪

38:51.840 --> 38:52.970
Let's go take a look.

38:54.680 --> 38:58.550
♪ The sky's vast and the road's long,
but with you by my side ♪

38:58.870 --> 39:00.610
♪ The twists and turns don't count ♪

39:01.070 --> 39:05.600
♪ I can tell with tears
that I have not lived in vain ♪

39:08.070 --> 39:09.130
You two lovebirds,

39:09.150 --> 39:10.110
would you like to

39:10.110 --> 39:11.510
make clay figurines for each other?

39:11.510 --> 39:12.280
We're not a couple.

39:12.280 --> 39:12.880
We'll try.

39:13.320 --> 39:14.650
Alright, just a moment.

39:15.000 --> 39:15.600
Thank you.

39:22.650 --> 39:25.520
♪ Take down the setting sun as my heart ♪

39:26.090 --> 39:29.450
♪ Fold the heaven and earth
to make my wings ♪

39:30.010 --> 39:31.500
♪ If fate shows no mercy ♪

39:31.900 --> 39:35.550
♪ Then don't blame my recklessness ♪

39:37.330 --> 39:40.530
♪ I thought this life
would drift like a solitary sail ♪

39:40.950 --> 39:44.120
♪ Yet I chanced upon you
in the smoke-filled alleyway ♪

39:42.190 --> 39:43.290
Make your own.

39:43.440 --> 39:44.660
Why are you looking at me?

39:44.660 --> 39:47.040
♪ Like a fleeting flower falling into ♪

39:46.320 --> 39:47.510
Since it's a gift for you,

39:47.510 --> 39:50.040
♪ My eyes ♪

39:47.920 --> 39:49.850
I should make it look more like you.

39:51.060 --> 39:53.530
♪ I suddenly realize
ripples are spreading ♪

39:53.980 --> 39:57.880
♪ Melting the frost,
lingering in my heart ♪

39:58.390 --> 39:59.830
♪ The light between your brows ♪

40:00.300 --> 40:02.190
♪ Is the kind of bloom ♪

40:02.750 --> 40:05.140
♪ That I love the most ♪

40:05.830 --> 40:08.330
♪ I truly feel I can forgive it all ♪

40:08.960 --> 40:12.660
♪ The sky's vast and the road's long,
but with you by my side ♪

40:13.140 --> 40:14.710
♪ The twists and turns don't count ♪

40:15.310 --> 40:19.790
♪ I can tell with tears
that I have not lived in vain ♪

40:19.630 --> 40:20.630
What are you making?

40:20.440 --> 40:24.790
♪ Not in vain ♪

40:35.200 --> 40:37.570
♪ I suddenly realized what it means
to be unmatched ♪

40:37.840 --> 40:39.030
The clay figurine you made

40:38.030 --> 40:42.280
♪ What it means to long,
what it means to burn ♪

40:39.880 --> 40:41.530
does resemble me somewhat.

40:42.720 --> 40:44.140
♪ The scars left along the way ♪

40:43.710 --> 40:44.490
You're mistaken.

40:44.490 --> 40:45.540
♪ In an instant, because of you ♪

40:45.150 --> 40:45.960
I shaped it casually.

40:45.940 --> 40:49.340
♪ With a smile, they ascend like feathers,
spreading in all directions ♪

40:48.300 --> 40:50.980
[Clay Sculpture]

40:49.850 --> 40:51.430
Why deny it, Miss?

40:49.910 --> 40:52.260
♪ I truly feel this love runs deep ♪

40:51.690 --> 40:52.950
The sculpture in your hands

40:52.950 --> 40:56.870
♪ What is moonlight,
that it makes me shine so bright? ♪

40:52.960 --> 40:55.290
is clearly modeled after this gentleman.

40:55.550 --> 40:56.400
And the one the gentleman made

40:56.400 --> 40:57.480
must be of the lady

40:57.320 --> 40:58.880
♪ I hold your hand tightly ♪

40:57.480 --> 40:58.540
beside you, right?

40:59.210 --> 41:03.690
♪ To protect the passion you keep hidden ♪

41:04.470 --> 41:08.470
♪ I so long to ♪

41:10.000 --> 41:11.480
Since you were sculpting a wolf,

41:11.480 --> 41:13.410
why were you looking at me earlier?

41:24.670 --> 41:25.470
Are you angry?

41:28.360 --> 41:30.090
What's there to be angry about?

41:32.430 --> 41:33.880
I sculpted a wolf

41:34.710 --> 41:35.920
because, in my heart,

41:35.920 --> 41:37.100
you're like a wolf.

41:37.480 --> 41:38.280
Intelligent,

41:38.760 --> 41:39.440
decisive,

41:40.360 --> 41:41.160
and fearless.

41:45.630 --> 41:46.550
In this life,

41:47.070 --> 41:48.360
you are the only person

41:49.280 --> 41:49.920
have I felt

41:49.920 --> 41:51.920
the joy of meeting a kindred spirit.

41:52.030 --> 41:52.840
And the happiness of having someone

41:52.840 --> 41:54.360
to fight alongside me.

41:55.670 --> 41:57.150
So I want to give this wolf

41:58.110 --> 41:58.840
to you.

42:07.630 --> 42:08.960
This is the first time

42:09.230 --> 42:11.090
I have ever given a gift to a woman.

42:11.710 --> 42:12.710
You cannot refuse it.
